Hello Hive friends,

How are you all doing? Did you saw the news about Hivefest? it's coming to Spain, Barcelona in September. I going to try and be there to. If you have the opportunity to go to Hivefest, I defensively recommend it. And if you are not in the opportunity to go, try to organize a little meeting yourself with the local Hivians living around you. It's good way to create content, learn from other hives and also make friends for life.

I had so much fun last week during the HOD in Alicante, I want everyone to experience that. I wanted to write about it in some kind of live blog but I only could make a post about the first day. I was editing pictures until around one o'clock the first night and that was just to late. Specially because my alarm went off 8 o'clock the next morning. An I wanted to start fresh at the program of day two.

Day two was a very interesting day full of good speakers and live performances. The food that we got was amazing and the people of Hive are just the best.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmYDfB5pPNqaqyrkJgrmQhs6i7Y26S4nXHgCQfv2bqY7eA/imgl3849.jpg" alt="@ninaeatshere in action" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmYFnfksPC5QLVVgs9rAjzi3xs6jGwymLZGJFHTGUZoH1y/imgl3946.jpg" alt="" />

The catering of this even was so good. I enjoyed it very much. And it was a good subject to create content too. As you can see, Nina from @worldmappin enjoyed every thing on the table shes sees in front of her.

She also had an amazing presentation of the @worldmappin project. And see here how [Wordmappin V2 is live](https://peakd.com/hive-163772/@worldmappin/exciting-news-worldmappin-v2-is-live)

I love this project. Go follow it and go out and create some contend for it. It's very easy, you probably have your favorite park just around the corner or that one small museum that you really like. But it's also possible to put up your favorite restaurant.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmUaNqkgv6VR3HpcP7nr3WZJQ1qux24PoMbckZZbmfUvHv/imgl3967.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmUQ2zDmKdy9RQKz1EeUVoER9hTZ1JZNRibK2S1zLmAKoF/imgl3968.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmcopaf7D59ZCC8WozuHyrhqvEn3bL62VnDwE4ef2jddB9/imgl3971.jpg" alt="" />

Our man @tibfox also has got some amazing projects running on here.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmdpTW4fzBFGfP1EQCgnPESrsZC1nJUt7FuX5da4YEtrwr/imgl3858.jpg" alt="" />

He introduced the team of @mantequilla-soft and he told us a bit on all the tools that they are building for Hive. He also was responsible for the creation of the translation software tat they were using during the event. It was life translation on screen and on you mobile. Very interesting piece of technology. Follow them at Mantequilla soft

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmQNTQtUNCo7sRRjD1NEgGqJuXyCvRQZg68aH1ukeAQyR3/imgl3892a.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmQ3RoMdp9ocNMjWaK27ECzKaQixiu9RF6qZAeSehaD3tT/1000105821.jpg" alt="" />

