If you are not able to scan these QR-codes, here are the links to Mantequilla-soft, the [Github](https://github.com/Mantequilla-Soft) and the [Ecency](https://ecency.com/@mantequilla-soft) account.

There was even an serious concert going on here to. @mipiano and @alessandrawhite played some wonderful notes. I did.t film it but if you keep looking on hive, there will probably be a person who is putting it on here.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmSrzPqrUEojFyDYnPL5BCZWFN3bApacJj1gim9LP7wcQF/1000105795.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmVojYzFcre2qe28MeLhqGfFywcnWFLrkLSk1Gaem5Hang/1000105796.jpg" alt="" />

We also had @livinguktaiwan telling about here life journey on Hive and how to use the different communities on hive. She told us that she had made a couple of hive communities were nothing is happening in any more. I am definitely going to post in the three challangescommunity. I have so many pictures with the theme three.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmXvAWxjLbX4FFpfhwLGbgPaN2uhuSLLnnfK6LN1hfXWmH/imgl3932.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmZrqQGsTE92JbHUYgob6K2ZJuU1Mi2WtUJ63marexqvuY/imgl3934.jpg" alt="" />

She showed us a cote of @ph1102 I think this is a beautiful one. For me, Hive is still a bit unanimous. So many people with strange names and numbers, and I am not a really good reader or writer, but meting people in real life is more my thing. Very good for me to see a face with a name. I also had a nice conversation with him about what I want to tell here. I think that is a very good question. I am struggling with that for a long time now. I am going to figure this out.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmNTmAy26B15uziFr4dz8gLdABVoxVP2wX3xpnaCVPynBW/imgl3938.jpg" alt="" />

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmNyvcYEjTF7HnMCcHEcLjpGWuQEpmY8FvYB8FtaXJ4LYW/imgl3910.jpg" alt="Gracias" />

Gracias for the people who organised this awesome event. I will be thinking of it for a long time.

And if you want to see all the speakers that were there this weekend, you can see the life streams back on this [YouTube page](https://www.youtube.com/@hiveopendays/streams).

And off course we needed to eat something at night. This evening we went to a Lebanese restaurant. It was very good there.

<img src="https://images.ecency.com/DQmRPEnMFTRW4yMreND4Fsfa9xE1AU1AwfP4vRHYC1K5ZBg/20260501_203140.jpg" alt="Here It started to be a little blurry already" />

